    <title>Journeys in India</title>
    <sub-title>Calcutta: City of Living History</sub-title>
    <desc>There is no city in India that is more British than Calcutta. The former capital of British India, Calcutta has gardens, buildings and museums to prove it. Throw away any ideas you have of this giant city and discover the treasures it holds.</desc>
