    <title>Kentucky Rifle</title>
    <desc>(1955) Suspenseful western with Chill Wills, Lance Fuller and Cathy Downs. When a gun-filled wagon breaks down in enemy territory, will its occupants surrender their cargo or fight for their lives?</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="64305451fc3be5947773c339-664e9d95e8824b0c34762787" start="20261012073710 +0000" stop="20261012090951 +0000">
    <title>Hellgate</title>
    <desc>(1952) Western starring Sterling Hayden. After the Civil War a rancher is wrongfully imprisoned in a notorious desert prison. When a deadly plague threatens to overwhelm the jail, can he help stop it?</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="64305451fc3be5947773c339-664e9d95e8824b0c34762787" start="20261012090951 +0000" stop="20261012103714 +0000">
    <title>Death Race 2000</title>
    <desc>(1975) High-speed dystopian action starring David Carradine and Sylvester Stallone. Buckle up for the Annual Transcontinental Death Race - with every car a deadly weapon, the traffic will be murder...</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="64305451fc3be5947773c339-664e9d95e8824b0c34762787" start="20261012103714 +0000" stop="20261012121221 +0000">
    <title>Nanny's Killer Scandal</title>
    <desc>(2020) Thriller with Mia Topalian. Unable to find a management job, Jamie becomes a nanny for a charismatic tycoon. But rejecting his advances will put her - like those before her - in mortal danger..</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="64305451fc3be5947773c339-664e9d95e8824b0c34762787" start="20261012121221 +0000" stop="20261012134517 +0000">
    <title>Killer Night Shift</title>
    <desc>(2018) Thriller with Ashleigh Dorrell. Amy begins her first night shift at a hotel. But this is a place with a dark past, and sometimes history repeats itself... Will she survive the graveyard shift?</desc>
  </programme>
  
